From: Ivan Faeton Danishevskyi <faeton@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:21:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Reboot credential: escrow, record and enrolment fixes

Escrow is cleared under a lock that capture and arming share and stays blocked until the
reboot, the stored record must have the exact size and parameters, an enrolment that
overlaps an owner credential change is refused, a corrupt record no longer blocks duress
enrolment or survives lock removal, and permission errors are thrown as before.
